			"notes": "Refuse to start next to **Alfheim** while the world height is extended. Alfheim rewrites chunk lighting with vanilla 0..256 section indices, which crashed extended worlds on load and could read light from the wrong section. Packs that keep the vanilla height (`min_world_y = 0`, `max_world_y = 256`) still load both mods together."
